  ["4-1-1","Cybersecurity requirements for the entity’s contracts and agreements with third parties shall be identified, documented, and approved.","third_party",3,"4-1","Cybersecurity requirements for the entity’s contracts and agreements with third parties shall be identified, documented, and approved.",{"ar":"يجب تحديد وتوثيق واعتماد متطلبات الأمن السيبراني ضمن العقود والاتفاقيات مع الأطراف الخارجية للجهة."}],
  ["4-1-2","Cybersecurity requirements for contracts and agreements with third parties, e.g. Service Level Agreement (SLA), which, if impaired, may affect the entity's data or services shall include the following as a minimum:","third_party",3,"4-1","Cybersecurity requirements for contracts and agreements with third parties, e.g. ServiceLevel Agreement(SLA), which, ifimpaired, may affect the entity's data or services shall include the following as a minimum:",{"ar":"يجب أن تغطي متطلبات الأمن السيبراني ضمن العقود والاتفاقيات (مثل اتفاقية مستوى الخدمة SLA) مع الأطراف الخارجية التي قد تتأثر بإصابتها بيانات الجهة أو الخدمات المقدمة لها بحد أدنى ما يلي:"}],
  ["4-1-2-1","Clauses of non-disclosure and the secure removal of the entity’s data by the third party upon the end of service.","third_party",4,"4-1-2","Clauses of non-disclosure and the secure removal of the entity’s data by the third party upon the end of service.",{"ar":"بنود المحافظة على سرية المعلومات (Non-Disclosure Clauses) والحذف الآمن من قبل الطرف الخارجي لبيانات الجهة عند انتهاء الخدمة."}],
  ["4-1-2-2","Communication procedures in case of the occurrence of a cybersecurity incident.","third_party",4,"4-1-2","Communication procedures in case of the occurrence of a cybersecurity incident.",{"ar":"إجراءات التواصل في حال حدوث حادثة أمن سيبراني."}],
  ["4-1-2-3","Obligating the third party to apply the entity’s cybersecurity requirements and policies and the relevant legislative and regulatory requirements.","third_party",4,"4-1-2","Obligating the third party to apply the entity’s cybersecurity requirements and policies and the relevant legislative and regulatory requirements.",{"ar":"إلزام الطرف الخارجي بتطبيق متطلبات وسياسات الأمن السيبراني للجهة والمتطلبات التشريعية والتنظيمية ذات العلاقة."}],
  ["4-1-3","Cybersecurity requirements for contracts and agreements with third parties providing IT or cybersecurity outsourcing or managed services shall include the following as a minimum:","third_party",3,"4-1","Cybersecurity requirements for contracts and agreements with third parties providing IT or cybersecurity outsourcing or managed services shall include the following as a minimum:",{"ar":"يجب أن تغطي متطلبات الأمن السيبراني مع الأطراف الخارجية التي تقدم خدمات إسناد لتقنية المعلومات، أو خدمات مدارة بحد أدنى ما يلي:"}],
  ["4-1-3-1","Conducting a cybersecurity risk assessment and ensuring the availability of risk mitigation controls before signing contracts and agreements orupon making changes to the relevant legislativeand…","third_party",4,"4-1-3","Conducting a cybersecurity risk assessment and ensuring the availability of risk mitigation controls before signing contracts and agreements orupon making changes to the relevant legislativeand regulatory requirements.",{"ar":"إجراء تقييم لمخاطر الأمن السيبراني، والتأكد من وجود ما يضمن السيطرة على تلك المخاطر، قبل توقيع العقود والاتفاقيات أو عند تغير المتطلبات التشريعية والتنظيمية ذات العلاقة."}],
  ["4-1-3-2","Cybersecurity managed service centers for monitoring and operations which use remote access shall be fully located in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.","third_party",4,"4-1-3","Cybersecurity managed service centers for monitoring and operations which use remote access shall be fully located in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.",{"ar":"أن تكون مراكز عمليات خدمات الأمن السيبراني المدارة للتشغيل والمراقبة، والتي تستخدم طريقة الوصول عن بعد، موجودة بالكامل داخل المملكة."}],
  ["4-1-4","Cybersecurity requirements for third parties shall be periodically reviewed.","third_party",3,"4-1","Cybersecurity requirements for third parties shall be periodically reviewed.",{"ar":"يجب مراجعة متطلبات الأمن السيبراني مع الأطراف الخارجية دورياً."}],
  ["4-2-1","Cybersecurity requirements for use of cloud computing and hosting services shall be identified, documented, and approved.","cloud_security",3,"4-2","Cybersecurity requirements for use of cloud computing and hosting services shall be identified, documented, and approved.",{"ar":"يجب تحديد وتوثيق واعتماد متطلبات الأمن السيبراني الخاصة باستخدام خدمات الحوسبة السحابية والاستضافة."}],
  ["4-2-2","Cybersecurity requirements for the cloud computing and hosting services within the entity shall be implemented.","cloud_security",3,"4-2","Cybersecurity requirements for the cloud computing and hosting services within the entity shall be implemented.",{"ar":"يجب تطبيق متطلبات الأمن السيبراني الخاصة بخدمات الحوسبة السحابية والاستضافة للجهة."}],
  ["4-2-3","In accordance with the relevant legislative and regulatory requirements, and in addition to the applicable controls in the Main Domains (1), (2), and (3) and Subdomain (4.1) that are necessary to protect the entity’s…","cloud_security",3,"4-2","In accordance with the relevant legislative and regulatory requirements, and in addition to the applicable controls in the Main Domains (1), (2), and (3) and Subdomain (4.1) that are necessary to protect the entity’s data or services provided thereto, cybersecurity requirements for use of cloud computing and hosting services shall include the following as a minimum:",{"ar":"بما يتوافق مع المتطلبات التشريعية والتنظيمية ذات العلاقة، وبالإضافة إلى ما ينطبق من الضوابط ضمن المكونات الرئيسية رقم (١) و(٢) و(٣) والمكون الفرعي رقم (٤-١) الضرورية لحماية بيانات الجهة أو الخدمات المقدمة لها، يجب أن تغطي متطلبات الأمن السيبراني الخاصة باستخدام خدمات الحوسبة السحابية والاستضافة بحد أدنى ما يلي:"}],
  ["4-2-3-1","Protection of entity’s data by cloud and hosting service providers in accordance with its classification level and returningdata(in a usableformat) upon service completion.","cloud_security",4,"4-2-3","Protection of entity’s data by cloud and hosting service providers in accordance with its classification level and returningdata(in a usableformat) upon service completion.",{"ar":"تصنيف البيانات قبل استضافتها لدى مقدمي خدمات الحوسبة السحابية والاستضافة، وإعادتها للجهة (بصيغة قابلة للاستخدام) عند انتهاء الخدمة."}],
  ["4-2-3-2","Separation of the entity’s environment (especially virtual servers) from environments of other entities within the cloud computing service provider.","cloud_security",4,"4-2-3","Separation of the entity’s environment (especially virtual servers) from environments of other entities within the cloud computing service provider.",{"ar":"فصل البيئة الخاصة بالجهة (وخصوصاً الخوادم الافتراضية) عن غيرها من البيئات التابعة لجهات أخرى في خدمات الحوسبة السحابية."}],
  ["4-2-4","Cybersecurity requirements for cloud computing and hosting services shall be periodically reviewed.","cloud_security",3,"4-2","Cybersecurity requirements for cloud computing and hosting services shall be periodically reviewed.",{"ar":"يجب مراجعة متطلبات الأمن السيبراني الخاصة بخدمات الحوسبة السحابية والاستضافة دورياً."}]
